  "details": "Using Debian 12, with Proton-GE 9-6\n\nIf you have two accounts with the same public avatar, change the avatars settings in the radial menu on the first account, then switch accounts and log back into another account with the same avatar, the avatar on the second account will now be set to whatever the first account was set to. Change it on the second account and go back to first, same thing.\n\nIf you log out, restart vrchat, then log back in to the other account, it doesn't seem to happen, only if you directly log out and back in. (Possibly the avatar's settings being kept in memory?)\n\n(edit: still exists in 1504)",
